c5bd3b22-bc40-4296-81c8-3278b317cff3	[Context: cardiovascular > stroke | ada]\nRecent trials show that these are much more beneficial for people with atherosclerotic coronary vascular disease (the buildup of fats, cholesterol, and other substances in and on the artery walls), heart disease, or heart failure. There are two classifications of medications: SGLT2 Inhibitors and GLP1 agonists.” —Seth Kluzwicz, SP, MD\n\nGive Today and Change lives!\n\nWith your support, the American Diabetes Association® can continue our lifesaving work to make breakthroughs in research and provide people with the resources they need to fight diabetes.	{"url": "https://diabetes.org/health-wellness/diabetes-and-your-heart", "title": "Stroke and Diabetes", "topic": "stroke", "source": "American Diabetes Association", "category": "cardiovascular", "file_path": "cardiovascular/stroke/clean/ada/v1.md", "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_org_code": "ada", "parent_document_id": "72e35004-b3dd-4662-bd88-80ebd4efcd13"}	[0.027634745,-0.0047285715,-0.020688994,-0.063946374,-0.03749399,-0.0068920185,0.0032730065,0.019602261,0.031589862,0.009216624,-0.0032862674,-0.003768803,-0.018756146,-0.008777414,0.10367424,0.02262879,0.0007802057,0.0052643614,0.024418727,0.0067444853,0.02703,-0.0043616667,0.008330455,-0.035024464,0.0019778388,-0.023591612,0.023082336,-0.025921542,0.021608314,0.020132694,0.0015059771,-0.011349273,0.0154195875,-0.003272373,0.045551665,0.011842385,0.02771717,-0.034124665,0.0033129647,-0.0014799638,-0.012030116,0.009973183,-0.017585997,0.0038475788,-0.015341044,-0.0032182948,0.005776571,-0.009876878,0.010311844,0.01916087,0.0052340613,-0.027772216,-0.020409973,-0.1772055,0.01721988,-0.0045869094,-0.024037004,-0.00446719,0.008258174,0.018811006,-0.0023652695,0.026442671,-0.026297152,-0.0033615464,0.0015877457,-0.029594462,0.041844793,-0.027726263,-0.029237794,0.012015947,0.011870583,0.013305877,0.01546786,-0.009947754,-0.013031208,-0.019573243,0.005934432,0.007895511,-0.000