5ee531e4-57ef-4e31-b3a8-db525f7838e6	[Context: complications > diabetic_retinopathy | ada]\nSearch below to find the diabetes program or resources in your area you've been looking for. Search for almost anything from medical care to education, to nutrition and health. Resources are available by ZIP Code so you can get the help you need wherever you are.\n\nAsk the Experts\n\nExperts in different medical specialties and other authorities in diabetes and eye health care answer questions, give advice, and share their knowledge.\n\nWhen your patients with diabetes or prediabetes lose their sight, it’s devastating. Explore our continuing education and practice and community resources.\n\nWith your support, the American Diabetes Association® can continue our lifesaving work to make breakthroughs in research and provide people with the resources they need to fight diabetes.	{"url": "https://diabetes.org/health-wellness/eye-health", "title": "Diabetic Retinopathy", "topic": "diabetic_retinopathy", "source": "American Diabetes Association", "category": "complications", "file_path": "complications/diabetic_retinopathy/clean/ada/v1.md", "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_org_code": "ada", "parent_document_id": "a82a3481-d346-4ba6-9e77-cd09be33f95e"}	[-0.002171037,-0.017444964,-0.006166441,-0.05412403,-0.038010247,0.0070576654,-0.00020636205,-0.006609938,0.027432926,0.00612814,-0.030288607,0.00014669042,-0.005297764,0.01650642,0.12589607,0.00977915,0.0051797233,-0.0061612744,0.006197132,0.0022787934,-0.008231456,-0.023798889,0.017091827,-0.020190775,0.014239673,-0.050933298,0.004422887,0.010527803,0.025035057,0.010310062,0.005647959,0.010599025,0.005967892,0.008609356,0.023382002,-0.01283563,-0.0028722922,-0.020279633,0.02474546,0.009030467,-0.0046195835,-0.0037593876,0.027468286,-0.02433377,0.024590401,0.00794659,-0.0052625057,-0.017517403,-0.008280363,0.026757114,-0.0014879707,0.0031029088,-0.03594492,-0.17486656,0.005799861,-0.0036028856,0.0011206574,0.03337194,0.0