e624bf97-ae10-48e4-a823-6273c73136ad	[Context: diabetes > glucose_metabolism | ada]\nThese tools can be lifesaving, but which is right for you? Discover the benefits and drawbacks of what's available to support your diabetes management needs.\n\nDiabetes can affect almost every part of your body, including your brain, heart, skin, kidneys, nerves, and ears. Learn how to prevent, delay, or treat these complications.\n\nVaccines help protect you from illnesses like the flu. Stay on top of the vaccines recommended for people living with diabetes to help you stay healthy.\n\nDo you ever get lost when talking to your healthcare team because you don't know what some of their words mean? To help you get the most out of your visits, here's a list of commonly used terms that are used when talking about diabetes.\n\nGet to know diabetes by the numbers, including diabetes stats for prevalence, complications, gender, race, and more.\n\nGive Today and Change lives!\n\nWith your support, the American Diabetes Association® can continue our lifesaving work to make breakthroughs in research and provide people with the resources they need to fight diabetes.	{"url": "https://diabetes.org/about-diabetes", "title": "Blood Glucose Regulation", "topic": "glucose_metabolism", "source": "American Diabetes Association", "category": "diabetes", "file_path": "diabetes/glucose_metabolism/clean/ada/v1.md", "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_org_code": "ada", "parent_document_id": "63a1ef38-aa83-4baa-8139-4b8a64d273de"}	[0.014834137,-0.02067245,-0.0058404966,-0.034173593,-0.020712992,0.004441143,0.0145413205,0.00816188,0.0230815,0.003067095,-0.026218174,-0.0046139346,-0.017306853,-0.0003741215,0.1177042,0.010511634,0.009518209,-0.013939279,0.010723994,0.020639447,0.011905883,-0.004906417,0.0051549715,-0.041449357,-0.0029805568,-0.014673966,0.0048543806,0.008088956,0.03046657,0.02124918,0.0015182471,0.023757813,0.024196327,-0.007177985,0.007023451,0.0047123814,-0.0112985745,-0.01640127,0