a07fee3e-5218-49ff-907f-8fee42b044b4	[Context: diabetes > insulin_resistance | niddk]\nDPPOS continues to follow DPP participants to see if lifestyle changes or taking metformin continue to prevent or delay type 2 diabetes over time. To date, the DPPOS has shown that people can prevent or delay type 2 diabetes for at least 15 years with lifestyle changes or metformin.\nReferences\n\nThis content is provided as a service of the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK), part of the National Institutes of Health. NIDDK translates and disseminates research findings to increase knowledge and understanding about health and disease among patients, health professionals, and the public. Content produced by NIDDK is carefully reviewed by NIDDK scientists and other experts.\n\nNIDDK would like to thank: Rita Basu, M.D., University of Alabama at Birmingham	{"url": "https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/diabetes/overview/what-is-diabetes/prediabetes-insulin-resistance", "title": "Insulin Resistance", "topic": "insulin_resistance", "source": "National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases", "category": "diabetes", "file_path": "diabetes/insulin_resistance/clean/niddk/v3.md", "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 6, "source_org_code": "niddk", "parent_document_id": "eb8fecf7-dbc5-4feb-9c38-cc0bc8fba3dd"}	[0.021787954,-0.023825325,-0.0050066616,-0.06647278,0.0037348084,0.016571775,-0.0020434177,0.016752701,0.00028147956,0.0022736108,0.0061834496,-0.003850429,0.003269319,0.013634667,0.10929504,0.02596871,0.0080285175,-0.030890092,0.012185238,-0.018881213,0.0022601688,-0.0047908584,-0.0002468697,0.0047310228,0.032668214,-0.018766232,0.0010367805,0.02020868,0.05139741,0.040440045,0.03975335,0.0207318,0.0054132873,-0.012685979,0.03134379,0.027847186,0.025341544,-0.021291556,-0.012480885,0.013881446,-0.005976344,0.004727616,-0.0037306056,0.023474874,0.026096845,0.013090108,0.00057447853,0.008961083,0.0026647516,0.03338171,0.0017471071