63a1738e-6086-4202-8f09-6ab7501117ea	[Context: diabetes > pancreas | niddk]\nThe Pediatric Artificial Pancreas (PEDAP) Trial found that artificial pancreas technology improved blood glucose level control in young children between ages 2 and 5 years with type 1 diabetes when compared with standard care methods.\n\nReferences\n\nThis content is provided as a service of the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK), part of the National Institutes of Health. NIDDK translates and disseminates research findings to increase knowledge and understanding about health and disease among patients, health professionals, and the public. Content produced by NIDDK is carefully reviewed by NIDDK scientists and other experts.\n\nNIDDK would like to thank: Sandra Lord, M.D., Benaroya Research Institute	{"url": "https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/diabetes/overview/what-is-diabetes/type-1-diabetes", "title": "Pancreas and Beta Cells", "topic": "pancreas", "source": "National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases", "category": "diabetes", "file_path": "diabetes/pancreas/clean/niddk/v1.md", "chunk_index": 8, "total_chunks": 9, "source_org_code": "niddk", "parent_document_id": "ad2e2bb7-31b2-49cd-82df-7b44f7acec1b"}	[0.0062765833,-0.027907353,-0.00871781,-0.07320484,-0.009635704,-0.009165235,-0.0049707713,0.014598579,0.015958821,-0.016834047,-0.009129321,-0.00030282873,0.0119441915,-0.0045671854,0.10104758,0.038066063,0.021638779,-0.0008624158,-0.015051586,-0.005739978,0.006894221,0.0113913035,0.00021239802,-0.0030089628,0.023431366,-0.019395553,-0.008351418,-0.0068330034,0.03488248,0.019931892,0.016625198,0.007415681,0.0024829174,-0.01819241,0.008708524,0.019404124,0.030102761,-0.036140673,0.0043828986,-0.00048744105,-0.020891009,-0.020335866,0.0067869583,0.018025557,0.007650309,0.0176652,-0.0060380925,0.00040300825,-0.0015810628,0.028100818,0.009833788,0.01839528,-0.017077949,-0.18939382,-0.023685517,-0.02945927,-0.0039082244,0.0