97405805-beb0-473d-9f55-d49aec140678	[Context: diabetes > type1_diabetes | mayo]\nBut with the right doctor, medical team and treatment, type 1 diabetes can be managed. So those who live with it can get on living. If you would like to learn even more about type 1 diabetes, watch our other related videos or visit mayoclinic.org. We wish you well.	{"url": "https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/type-1-diabetes/symptoms-causes/syc-20353011", "title": "Type 1 Diabetes", "topic": "type1_diabetes", "source": "Mayo Clinic", "category": "diabetes", "file_path": "diabetes/type1_diabetes/clean/mayo/v1.md", "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_org_code": "mayo", "parent_document_id": "8b4cf7db-3875-4146-9bc2-3fe08688935f"}	[-0.002765337,-0.03306857,0.002222042,-0.060969364,-0.026390368,-0.01265616,-0.004183493,0.026708432,0.021200135,-0.0006436044,-0.0065433085,2.7758422e-05,0.009524911,0.036871903,0.13705531,0.011251207,0.030929912,-0.008420524,0.006078724,0.0155703975,-0.015755523,-0.010493391,-0.0035881249,0.00072786835,0.014450973,-0.01569389,-0.0017305895,0.008338587,0.013570202,0.012138825,0.031373546,0.04330777,0.011911682,0.017088808,-0.01083066,0.016632015,-0.0018093872,-0.021297246,-0.006363782,-0.0065299883,-0.0100454455,-0.0056122113,0.01214529,0.0006661877,-0.0058179665,0.0021300707,0.00011455083,0.0042720293,0.014222941,0.04958542,-0.02264848,0.012310306,-0.009408085,-0.17282532,-0.008316572,-0.01399465,-0.0027350397,-0.003417392,-0.018318921,0.011878468,-0.009226991,0.0120581435,-0.014379833,0.005105135,-0.015001232,-0.013054258,0.01329949,-0.003112065,0.0034247518,-0.021360544,0.02795666,0.0012122495,-0.011672719,0.0032531961,-0.004696721,-0.0047832234,-0.005483955,0.009382442,0.002353615,0.0019162098,0.008797166,-0.005272214,-0.03503253,-0.019861456,0.0045227716,0.004835566,0.0007468755,0.0024144815,-0.01555893,0.017422283,-0.0045772004,0.00018080951,0.0035966916,-0.001990406,-0.027482005,-0.0058573843,-0.020945363,-0.043378666,-0.0019408674,0.