1d78b54d-ac2a-419f-aa91-6472c4ac2a31	[Context: kidney > egfr | niddk]\nAll estimating equations estimate GFR. A person’s actual GFR may be higher or lower than the estimate. GFR may be best assessed by monitoring trends over time rather than a single point estimate. Estimating equations become less accurate as GFR increases.\nLearn about the equation used in this calculator.\n\nReferences\n\nThis content is provided as a service of the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK), part of the National Institutes of Health. NIDDK translates and disseminates research findings to increase knowledge and understanding about health and disease among patients, health professionals, and the public. Content produced by NIDDK is carefully reviewed by NIDDK scientists and other experts.	{"url": "https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/professionals/clinical-tools-patient-management/kidney-disease/laboratory-evaluation/estimated-gfr-calculators/adults-pediatrics", "title": "eGFR", "topic": "egfr", "source": "National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases", "category": "kidney", "file_path": "kidney/egfr/clean/niddk/v3.md", "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_org_code": "niddk", "parent_document_id": "dbae66e0-fc9f-4152-9e90-062abbe93ae1"}	[-0.0036083686,-0.015953148,-0.0006016809,-0.05669085,0.008854405,-0.010201863,0.012045663,-0.0029029057,-0.0057074414,0.00064114184,-0.0016681117,-0.023088543,-0.014356699,-0.010418681,0.12337454,0.06120625,0.010137484,0.009985295,0.013145813,-0.0071621975,0.01054581,0.031471327,-0.01377453,0.010852661,0.022526303,-0.021863086,0.010418365,-0.0038581234,0.033084653,0.014747336,0.0074100047,-0.008819333,0.023018626,0.01129044,0.020207778,0.024745114,0.034145232,-0.034228344,-0.00037838033,-0.00887564,-0.010971916,-0.0072185756,-0.0062829778,-0.00076824886,-0.0035523705,0.0035902776,-0.025918562,-0.0035954802,0.021040736,0.02812856,0.012364278,0.0011732926,-0.024547655,-0.1659336,-0.016