f6efba56-56e6-410e-a22a-95b39dd193c9	[Context: kidney > urine_creatinine | cleveland]\nBut the earlier a provider detects kidney disease, the easier it is for them to delay or even prevent kidney failure. Talk to a provider about how you can care for your kidneys.\n\nSign up for our Health Essentials emails for expert guidance on nutrition, fitness, sleep, skin care and more.\n\nLearn more about the Health Library and our editorial process.\n\nCleveland Clinic’s health articles are based on evidence-backed information and review by medical professionals to ensure accuracy, reliability and up-to-date clinical standards.\n\nCleveland Clinic’s primary care providers offer lifelong medical care. From sinus infections and high blood pressure to preventive screening, we’re here for you.	{"url": "https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diagnostics/urine-albumin-creatinine-ratio", "title": "Urine Creatinine", "topic": "urine_creatinine", "source": "Cleveland Clinic", "category": "kidney", "file_path": "kidney/urine_creatinine/clean/cleveland/v1.md", "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_org_code": "cleveland", "parent_document_id": "058def15-1e96-4144-84a8-284b6716ed89"}	[-0.001901787,0.014254277,-0.0021228571,-0.035450663,0.009179279,0.0035283812,0.020126877,0.026400158,0.009421906,0.00043024405,-0.024158778,-0.025984693,-0.03551447,-0.017793212,0.10467678,0.012578403,0.016666617,0.0035058877,0.007432629,-0.018081449,-0.008411403,0.013248845,0.0077937366,0.014335497,0.005128998,-0.012874942,0.031615783,-0.0022593753,0.03502818,0.018460423,0.003223569,-0.024047298,0.012240299,0.015044655,0.028131077,0.02440978,0.01688921,-0.031031018,-0.0015257887,0.02082447,-0.0038092784,0.005781756,0.0035450782,0.0021467549,0.0033609245,0.0015541149,-0.010195204,0.011279982,0.024598101,0.027108273,0.01269923,0.005265156,-0.023469556,-0.1699064,-0.00091975066,-0.019252108,0.016097793,0.009005382,0.01263883,-0.012494221,-0.023470197,0.04059646,-0.022459604,-0.024076633,-0.00652219,-0.0