4,0.025985487,0.0028982966,-0.012867834,-0.010796114,-0.017267283,0.0063228332,-5.4654833e-05,-0.033060193,-0.0011823346,0.013795021,-0.011786896,0.035576858,-0.0046249083,-0.0058961427,0.0075544114,-0.0019292799,0.0077720513,-0.012167656,-0.004433523,0.011310474,0.013049219,-0.015842622,0.017813068,0.013392711,0.004904147,0.027751574,-0.028356723,0.01392083,-0.011289269,0.0045888596,-0.014591046,0.037667498,0.0016060285,-0.009950765,0.009344936,-0.0039268383,0.007987638,-0.033675075,-0.009678853,-0.00938203,0.0112952795,-0.017517207,-0.005481801,0.024620527]
ed86c2ba-d44a-4bb0-a68e-75dfd31e7c94	[Context: liver > fatty_liver | cleveland]\nSteatotic liver disease is also linked to a higher risk of heart disease, liver cancer and other health conditions.\n\nHealthcare providers often find steatotic liver disease during routine tests for other conditions.\n\nTo diagnose it, your provider will do a physical exam. They’ll check for signs of inflammation, like an enlarged liver. They’ll also ask about your medical history.\n\nTests your provider may use to diagnose the condition include:\n\nThese tests help confirm fat buildup in your liver and check for inflammation or scarring.\n\nIn many cases, treatment can help reverse or improve the condition during its early stages. It often depends on the type. In 2024 and 2025, the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) approved new medications to improve scarring and inflammation in the liver.\n\nFatty liver disease treatment focuses on:\n\nIn some cases, providers may recommend medication to help manage certain health conditions. Severe cases may require a liver transplant.\n\nRecovery depends on how early your provider finds and treats the condition. Early-stage steatotic liver disease can sometimes improve within months. More advanced disease may require long-term management.\n\nMany people with steatotic liver disease live long, healthy lives. In some cases, making changes in your daily life can reduce fat in your liver and prevent further damage. When caught early, you can often reverse or manage the disease.\n\nWithout treatment, the disease can lead to severe scarring or cirrhosis and liver failure. But treatment can still help manage symptoms and slow progression.\n\nTaking steps to improve your overall health can make a meaningful difference over time.\n\nSteatotic (fatty) liver disease is common. But it doesn’t always lead to serious problems. When you get an early diagnosis, you may be able to reverse it with healthy changes. As it progresses, it can become more serious and require ongoing care. Paying attention to risk factors and symptoms can help you act sooner. And working with your provider can help protect your liver over time.\n\nSign up for our Health Essentials emails for expert guidance on nutrition, fitness, sleep, skin care and more.\n\nLearn more about the Health Library and our editorial process.\n\nCleveland Clinic’s health articles are based on evidence-backed information and review by medical professionals to ensure accuracy, reliability and up-to-date clinical standards.\n\nManaging your weight, blood pressure, cholesterol and diabetes, exercising and eating better can help fatty liver disease. Cleveland Clinic can care for you.	{"url": "https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/15831-fatty-liver-disease", "title": "Fatty Liver Disease", "topic": "fatty_liver", "source": "Cleveland Clinic", "category": "liver", "file_path": "liver/fatty_liver/clean/cleveland/v1.md", "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_org_code": "cleveland", "parent_document_id": "76933a01-b019-46c0-8fa1-55e3d4e56350"}	[0.009885509,-0.031860083,-0.0037944592,-0.051380444,0.003887049,0.005508087,0.0046788915,0.028070044,0.018998034,0.022244727,-0.023272235,-0.012955112,-0.011516111,-0.009477534,0.11040946,0.02089583,0.0014426798,0.024906822,0.01524082,0.0006054341,0.028606877,0.00026416735,0.008032714,0.0007475393,-0.011310056,-0.010197315,0.034374103,-0.018591842,0.02196867,-0.001112932,0.004281792,-0.011532766,0.016609266,0.0033919131,-0.0019231397,0.026188161,-0.0004888587,-0.010113464,-0.006675869,0.004753436,-0.007874903,-0.003588952,-0.008112782,0.030592943,0.007064414,0.013951186,0.01406482,0.005111696,0.015449118,-0.00086809194,-0.007773788,-0.016107447,-0.024720984,-0.17757337,0.015532003,0.0018063579,0.0046284404,-0.026375694,-4.8550773e-06,-0.016438175,-0.02416146,0.029148646,-0.023564223,-0.022130571,-0.0035718908,-0.016862473,0.019864917,-0.020031326,-0.012498164,-0.009840826,0.012730682,-0.0017852611,0.0007839747,-0.01891