84,0.014522185,0.0032220758,-0.014972526,0.016201304,0.008369744,-0.010029579,0.0005791067,-0.0023533802,0.00026715486,0.015415904,-0.019782145,-0.010554916,-0.011057256,-0.010469854,-0.010930909,-0.0011613909,-0.0507901,0.012903268,-0.026462995,0.027665768,0.028001891,-0.0023788833,0.012847417,-0.01571611,0.0060429904,-0.024316708,-0.0047623115,0.009222962,0.03346924,-0.0038203641,0.002722818,-0.0038659708,-0.018087016,-0.007503467,-0.007265397,0.015235826,0.012389731,0.0094901,0.0015047223,-0.011101152,0.027121635,-0.006910558,0.021079835,0.0070435763,-0.008194526,-0.028197661,0.010736669,0.010052451,0.04628552,0.014740328]
ac1c6b77-683f-461b-89cd-4425feb51e7d	[Context: medications > sulfonylureas | medlineplus]\nIf you eat too much or skip meals or snacks\nIf you are taking new medicines, took too much insulin or other diabetes medicine by mistake, or took your medicine at the wrong time\nIf your blood sugar has been higher or lower than normal\nIf you are drinking alcohol\n\nKeep a record for yourself and your provider. This will be a big help if you are having problems managing your diabetes. It will also tell you what works and what doesn't work, to keep your blood sugar under control. Record:\n\nThe time of day\nYour blood sugar level\nThe amount of carbohydrates you ate\nThe type and dose of your diabetes medicines\nThe type of exercise you do and for how long\nAnything unusual, such as feeling stressed, eating different foods, or being sick\n\nMany glucose meters let you store this information. Ask your provider about the best way to record this information so they can more easily help you.\n\nYou and your provider should set a target goal for your blood sugar levels for different times during the day. If your blood sugar is higher than your goals for 3 days and you don't know why, contact your provider.\n\nRandom blood sugar values are often not that useful to your provider and this can be frustrating to people with diabetes. Often fewer values with more information (meal description and time, exercise description and time, medicine dose and time) related to the blood sugar value are much more useful to help guide medicine decisions and dose adjustments.\n\nRecommended Blood Sugar Targets\n\nFor people with type 1 diabetes, the American Diabetes Association (ADA) recommends that blood sugar targets be based on a person's needs and goals, including whether they are pregnant and whether they use a CGM device. Talk to your provider and diabetes educator about the best goals for you. General guidelines are:\n\nBefore meals, your blood sugar should be:\n\nFrom 90 to 130 mg/dL (5.0 to 7.2 mmol/L) for adults\nFrom 90 to 130 mg/dL (5.0 to 7.2 mmol/L) for children, 13 to 19 years old\nFrom 90 to 180 mg/dL (5.0 to 10.0 mmol/L) for children, 6 to 12 years old\nFrom 100 to 180 mg/dL (5.5 to 10.0 mmol/L) for children under 6 years old	{"url": "https://medlineplus.gov/ency/patientinstructions/000086.htm", "title": "Sulfonylureas", "topic": "sulfonylureas", "source": "MedlinePlus", "category": "medications", "file_path": "medications/sulfonylureas/clean/medlineplus/v1.md", "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 5, "source_org_code": "medlineplus", "parent_document_id": "38b6fce0-2032-496a-a828-ad6d8e54608a"}	[0.002417703,0.0060464125,-0.0017622425,-0.038160577,0.009985931,-0.024087256,0.023951566,0.017010974,0.0059964973,0.003192401,0.022997167,-0.0062270937,-0.008368349,-0.0074021583,0.12249615,0.025344415,-0.0037592074,-0.0057283174,-0.012021559,0.013145746,-0.010586806,-0.0036968375,0.009482424,-0.014326319,0.008995464,0.00062412454,-0.008492635,-0.0103051355,0.036891848,0.041281566,0.01636693,0.010196694,0.015587458,0.007867299,0.007598482,-0.0062902886,0.004820438,-0.024648033,0.0068952995,0.010380708,0.011467238,0.040233362,0.005842244,0.0103294095,-0.0074981838,0.017373988,-0.014104274,0.009314719,0.03300376,0.02910633,-0.007819853,0.010607179,-0.023501972,-0.19919567,0.0071228473,-0.00039708233,0.0027093473,0.0077824886,-0.010353719,-0.022200784,-0.025003973,0.01456208,-0.004951981,0.0004451314,-0.0036131877,-0.019066276,0.014951465,-0.04620353,-0.0051073493,-0.023016276,0.006434425,0.0033925138,0.0057711997,0.0054180915,-0.015075157,0.003788849,-0.025738234,-0.004726347,-0.013869165,-0.0137674585,-0.03559944,-0.011490827,-0.01886486,-3.3495435e-05,-0.01463147,-0.010324312,-0.008753691,-0.0051839524,-0.009588035,0.010589179,-0.012405232,0.009441557,-0.0062820683,0.009719043,-0.015780307,0.007684561,0.018848967,-0.00060851756,0.026365409,-0.029300686,-0.032901336,-0.0014540404,0.027805332,0.019715222,-0.0138524,0.0025995527,0.013000892,0.018359689,-0.